        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 6020, 8-1/4 Inch Tuscany Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 8-1/4 Inch Tuscany Lockset is made out of cast bronze for a rustic appearance that looks like it comes straight from the old world. And adding that sort of character to your home's front door will go a long way in making a lasting first impression on your guests. Only the boldest sort of people know how to use these Tuscany Bronze Sideplates in a way that will bring life to a traditional house. This 8-1/4 Inch Tuscany Lockset is available in both a dummy function and a single cylinder function. Choose from a wide array of matching knobs and levers for an end look that capture's your home's unique style. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Lost Wax Cast Bronze Tuscany Entry Door Sideplate Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Tuscany Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): <b>3-5/8\" Center to Center</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-6020-specifications.pdf?v=1704262348\"><b>Emtek 6020 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-6020-finish.jpg?v=1704354649\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 6020 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
